<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines' June production indices slightly up.</title>
<headline>Philippines' June production indices slightly up.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine manufacturing output in both value and volume terms inched up in June, the National Statistics Office said on Friday.</p>
<p>The June value of production index rose by 8.5 percent year-on-year to 454.8 from 419.1 in the same month last year.</p>
</text>
